  <h2>About cleaning-services procurement</h2>
  <p>
    Cleaning services are one of the largest steady-state SMME procurement categories in government. Every
    department, hospital, school complex, court, police station, and SOE facility runs cleaning contracts,
    typically on multi-year terms. The sector includes general facility cleaning, specialised hospital and
    laboratory hygiene, hygiene consumables supply (paper, soap, dispensers), and integrated facility
    management contracts that bundle cleaning with related services.
  </p>

  <h2>Detailed sector hub — coming soon</h2>
